        "language": "english",
        "review": "This is simply a bad game! It fails in almost every aspect what makes a good rogue like (I played the game for about 3 hours- 2 hours offline)\n1. The progression system is a joke: there is only two updates (the most boring ones:  xp-gain and health!)\n2. There are 8 weapons that can be unlocked after a huge grind fest, and not for money but for bounty -money????-wtf\n3. Its grindy as hell\n4. The levels are boring and all look the same\n5. Minor flaws: No map or minimap. + you cannot even read your health bar because it is too small\n5. Most important: the gameplay: it simply consist of kiting mobs and going in circles for hours which is exactly as much fun as it sounds like\nI actually cannot understand the good reviews. Maybe those guys have never played good rogue likes like Binding of  isaac or Nuclear throne?",
